(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ac-11"] = {"468353101":[["Georgia Mercenary","Boss, smooth trip?"],["","——"],["","A dull thud. Georgia drops the heavy black bag from her shoulder, then works the kinks from her neck, shoulders, and lower back. Her joints answer with a string of clicks."],["Georgia","Kent's dealt with. Didn't meet anyone else itching for trouble on the way. Smooth enough."],["","Georgia works the stiffness from her body and looks down the road. Dust blurs the far end, but a squat block of buildings takes shape through the haze."],["Georgia","Sema Town... This is it?"],["Georgia Mercenary","Yes, boss. Follow this road into town. Sankara's only a few kilometers farther north."],["Georgia","That close?"],["Georgia Mercenary","Uh, closer than we expected, boss. Sema Town's an odd one. It sits near DL territory, but the DL has no authority here."],["Georgia Mercenary","It started as a \"safe house\" a legendary mercenary built for himself after retiring. He chose a spot near Sankara because he knew the major powers would keep their hands off it rather than invite suspicion."],["Georgia Mercenary","With no faction holding the leash, every kind of drifter washed up here. Eventually, the place built its own system of rule..."],["Georgia","Heh. An unrecognized mercenary den. Nothing more."],["Georgia Mercenary","Uh... Fair enough."],["Georgia","Unrecognized or not, it could become a real problem in the wrong hands—"],["","Georgia's face gives nothing away."],["Georgia","The man I'm after. Any leads?"],["Georgia Mercenary","Uh... Sorry, boss..."],["","One look at her aide's stammering tells Georgia everything. She bends, picks up her bag, and starts walking."],["Georgia Mercenary","H-Hey! Boss! Wait up!"],["Georgia","Not your fault. If the intel's right and he's a veteran politician from the UNCS mainland, he didn't slip into Sema Town without layers of cover... I wasn't counting on you to find him for me."],["Georgia","I'm taking over. We start with the local authorities. Intel says the politician made contact with their top brass. We find out why."],["Georgia Mercenary","Wait, boss—"],["","Her aide hurries after her and catches her by the arm."],["Georgia Mercenary","We didn't come up completely empty—our people have combed every corner of Sema Town these past few days. We did flag a few suspicious characters..."],["","Dancers surge through the open-air bar. The damp air hangs thick with spent fireworks and woodsmoke."],["Hayato","Ah, ah—choo!"],["","Hayato rubs his nose, trying to soothe the sting left by the sudden, acrid smell."],["","He pushes through the crowd toward the makeshift bar. Three wrong turns and three angry locals later, he finally spots the man he's here with—"],["Hayato","Why didn't you wait for me outside the restaurant? We said we'd eat, then turn in early. Mr. Alton—"],["Sunny","Come on! Have a drink first!"],["","Sunny cuts him off, hooks an arm around his shoulders, and signals the bartender for another round."],["Hayato","No, no! I'm done drinking! Sunny, shouldn't we head back? Our employer has an important meeting tomorrow. We need to keep him safe. You promised you wouldn't drink tonight..."],["Sunny","Tch! You're no fun, kid. I have a few drinks and you start yapping—hic... Hey, loosen up. We've been wound tight for days. Time to... hic! Time to r-relax!"],["Hayato","We've stayed on guard this long. What's one more night?"],["Hayato","*mumbling* B-Besides, I haven't seen a single night go by without you hitting the bar…"],["Sunny","What're you muttering about over there?"],["Hayato","N-Nothing. I'm just worried about tomorrow's job. Mr. Alton made us swear we wouldn't screw it up."],["Sunny","Oh, spare me. If trouble was coming, it'd have hit us already. Why wait till the very end? Ha! Hayato... you don't even know who Alton's meeting, do you?"],["","Hayato's eyes widen. He glances around, tense, then drops his voice."],["Hayato","You know...? How? Mr. Alton never said a word."],["Sunny","Last time Alton called him, I heard the voice. Barton Stewart. Used to be a big-name mercenary boss. I've seen the man myself. Never figured he'd end up the \"mayor\" of Sema Town."],["Hayato","It's really him... Then Mr. Alton must be here for something big."],["Sunny","No kidding. He didn't come to Milkhama for the scenery. What I can't figure out is how he got Barton to take him seriously—seriously enough to work with him... Tch."],["Sunny","Anyway, now you know. With Barton running the show tomorrow, what could possibly go wrong? We dress sharp, make Alton look important, and—"],["","A clean clink cuts Sunny off. Someone sets a fresh drink in front of him."],["Sunny","This is..."],["","Sunny looks up. The light is low, and a wide hood hides the stranger's face. All he can make out is a lean woman."],["Sunny","Well, hello, gorgeous. Here alone?"],["","A pleasure, gentlemen. This one's on me. Call it an introduction."],["","Oh, I couldn't possibly—"],["","Sunny beams and raises the glass to drain it. Hayato catches his wrist."],["Hayato","You really can't have any more! We need to go!"],["Sunny","Honestly, you—"],["","Tap, tap. The stranger raps twice against the glass tabletop."],["","I couldn't help hearing you mention Mr. Barton..."],["","Sunny and Hayato trade a quick look. In the split second Hayato freezes, Sunny downs the drink."],["Hayato","Unbelievable..."],["","I mean no harm. Work's been thin lately, so I came to try my luck in Sema Town. I heard you mention Mr. Barton. Forgive me for asking, but do you do business with him?"],["","......"],["","Buuuuurp!"],["","A brief silence. Then Sunny lets out a long, thunderous belch."],["Hayato","Uh, my friend... h-he's drunk. Sorry! We need to go!"],["","Gentlemen..."],["Hayato","You must've misheard. We were talking about a trip to Burton Bay after the job. Barton? Never heard of him. Thanks for the drink—we'll be going. See you around!"],["","Hayato hauls Sunny upright and hustles him out."],["Georgia Mercenary","Boss. Your call?"],["","Mercenaries gather around the hooded woman, Georgia's trusted aide at their head."],["Georgia","These two..."],["Georgia Mercenary","Our people have seen them here several times. The one called Sunny loves his liquor. Once he's drunk, he starts bragging—and forgets how loud he is."],["Georgia Mercenary","Thanks to him, we picked up a few useful leads. Sunny and the young man you just met are working as bodyguards for a mysterious newcomer."],["Georgia Mercenary","Word is the man only recently landed on the island, and he's preparing to make a move in Sema Town. Given our target's profile, he may be using a more Milkhama-style cover..."],["","Georgia says nothing. One glance is enough. Her aide nods, then shoulders through the crowd."],["Hayato","I told you not to drink so much... We're still a long way from our place. It'll be late by the time we walk back, and if we oversleep tomorrow... Oh, no. I can't even think about it."],["","Hayato keeps Sunny propped against him as they walk, sighing every few steps."],["Hayato","Bodyguard work isn't exactly complicated, Sunny. If we screw up even this, how are we supposed to survive in Milkhama?"],["Hayato","...Before I came back, I promised Bobby I'd never take another job that could land me in prison. I can't break that promise."],["Sunny","Do you ever shut up? Isn't Bobby your dog?"],["Hayato","Huh?! Sunny, you're awake?"],["Sunny","I never passed out. You think that little splash could put me down?"],["","Sunny shoves Hayato aside and casts a wary look back. Only a handful of strangers dot the road behind them. Some of the tension leaves his shoulders."],["Sunny","Good. That woman didn't follow us... Come on. Let's move, and quit nagging."],["Hayato","You're the one who spills everything the second you start drinking."],["Sunny","Tch. Nothing happened the last few days. Then tonight, suddenly we've got eyes on us... Weird. Who the hell was she? Never seen her here before."],["Hayato","Could she be one of Mr. Barton's enemies?"],["Sunny","Who knows? If she's got a score with Barton, she can take it up with Barton. Why bother us...? Ah, I'm done walking. Hayato, bring the ST around. We'll get back faster."],["Hayato","Well... alright. Wait here."],["","Hayato helps Sunny sit at the foot of a large rock. He gets a few steps away, hesitates, then runs back."],["Hayato","Don't sneak back for another drink."],["Sunny","Yeah, yeah. Enough already. I'm too drunk and tired to move. Go get the ST. Quick there, quick back."],["","Hayato tears off. Sunny leans against the rock, draws a deep breath, and savors the night's liquor. He's enjoying the afterglow when a cold breeze crawls over him, sending goosebumps racing down one side of his body."],["Sunny","What the...?"],["","If you're too drunk to walk, I've got time to give you a ride, friend."],["","The familiar voice drifts in from nearby. Sunny jolts, half his drunken haze burning away in an instant."],["Sunny","That's... awfully kind, but I'll pass."],["","Sunny smiles, braces against the rock, and rises slowly. His mind races through exits."],["","In seconds, strangers flood into view behind the hooded woman. Hard faces. Bad intentions."],["Sunny","What's all this...?"],["Georgia Mercenary","Easy. We just have a few questions."],["Sunny","Ha-ha. I'm nobody. I only know enough to make a living... Besides, friend, have we met?"],["","Doesn't matter, Sunny. I want to talk about your employer."],["","......"],["","Sunny's eyes harden. She knows his name."],["Sunny","Tch... My employer? Just a tourist on vacation. Paid us a little extra to keep him safe, that's all. What, you people got a problem with him?"],["","......"],["","Georgia says nothing. Her aide raises a gun and aims it at Sunny."],["","Sunny flinches, forces a smile, and lifts both hands. No resistance."],["","I don't want guesses. Give me your employer's name. Has he been in contact with Barton Stewart?"],["","...I'd love to give you every last detail. Honestly. But—"],["","Bang!"],["","A gunshot cracks. A fresh bullet hole smokes at Sunny's feet."],["Sunny","I don't know! I swear I don't! My employer's careful. He tells us nothing beyond the job!"],["","Click. Sunny sees the woman across from him lining up a second shot."],["Sunny","He does have an important meeting tomorrow! I don't know who with—I only guessed Barton. Anyone planning something in Sema Town needs Barton's approval, right?"],["","......"],["","Silence hangs for several seconds."],["","Good. Then tomorrow, I'm joining that meeting."],["","Wh-What?!"],["","That won't be a problem, will it?"],["","Me?! Wait, who the hell are you people? Why—"],["","Bang! Another shot. The argument dies in Sunny's throat."],["Georgia Mercenary","Stop asking questions. Do as you're told. We pay our debts. Once this is done, you'll be compensated."],["Sunny","...Tch. Doesn't look like I have much choice."],["","Of course... unless you'd rather die here—"],["","A flashbang screams through the air and detonates without warning. White light rips across the scene. Everyone turns away and shields their eyes."],["","Everyone but Sunny. His shades are already on. He yanks the buzzing comm from his pocket; the instant the line opens, Hayato's voice floods through."],["Hayato","Sunny?! Are you alright? I heard gunshots!"],["Sunny","Relax, relax! Still breathing! Good ears, kid. Bet it caught every last one of them—ha-ha-ha-ha!"],["Hayato","Then get down here! The crew's ready to pull out."],["Sunny","Pull out? Those two dames just pissed me off! I'm settling this score tonight. Sit tight—I'm coming to you!"],["","On the surface, the glare fades. Sunny is gone. Georgia frowns, pulls out a terrain scanner, and sweeps the area."],["Georgia","There's a cavity under this building. Probably an old air-raid shelter. Odds are, that's where he went. Seal every entrance the scan picked up. Don't let him slip out."],["Georgia Mercenary","Yes, boss! Right—"],["Georgia","Wait."],["","Red dots flare across Georgia's terminal. Several STs in the underground chamber are already powering up."],["Georgia","Looks like he wants to play with us."],["Georgia","Heh. Then let's play. Wouldn't want to disappoint him."]],"468353301":[["Hayato","Sunny! We can't hold much longer! Fall back, now!"],["Sunny","Damn. I underestimated them! That woman's a monster—who the hell is she?!"],["Hayato","Forget it! We've got an escape route. There's another passage beneath this bunker—we're blowing it open now!"],["Georgia","You've already lost. Stop struggling—"],["","Blue Bird flips both blades into a reverse grip and tears toward the enemy line."],["Georgia Mercenary","Wait, Boss! Something's wrong!"],["","Georgia's eyes widen. She slams on the emergency brake. A blinding blast erupts less than ten meters ahead of Blue Bird. A violent energy surge shreds the ground into jagged debris."],["Georgia Mercenary","They're escaping through an underground passage! After them!"],["Georgia","Stop! Pull back!"],["","The moment Georgia gives the order, deafening explosions thunder up from below. The ground where their STs stood moments ago starts to buckle."],["Georgia Mercenary","Those dirty bastards—"],["Georgia","Forget it. That passage masks detection signals. Clearing the route and chasing them would cost us too much time."],["Georgia Mercenary","Then the lead's dead?"],["","The channel falls silent for several seconds."],["Georgia","We move out. Proceed with the plan."],["","High on a hill, a towering man watches in silence as Georgia's ST unit files out of the half-collapsed building."],["","Only after Georgia's unit vanishes beyond the horizon does the man beside him speak."],["Guard Member","Want us to look into them?"],["Aiden","Not yet. This is Sema Town. Fights break out here every day. As long as they don't threaten Sankara..."],["Aiden","Since we're on the subject... I got a tip recently. Someone important just arrived in town."],["Guard Member","Huh? Someone important? What're they doing here?"],["Aiden","Ever since Vesper appeared, Sankara's been in the crosshairs. Things are unstable. Some faction may try to exploit the chaos."],["Guard Member","You think... this big shot's after Sankara?"],["Aiden","I don't know. That's why we stay sharp."],["Aiden","Starting tomorrow, put more people in the field. Keep a close watch on the area around Sema Town. Anyone suspicious gets detained first, questioned later."],["Guard Member","Got it."],["Aiden","Let's go. Patrol's over for today."],["","Sunny and Hayato stagger back to the base, gasping. Without a word, each downs two glasses of water."],["Sunny","Huff... huff... That run damn near killed me. Didn't feel it while we were running for our lives... Now I feel like I'm dying."],["Hayato","Huff... huff... Y-Yeah... this is definitely tougher than training..."],["Sunny","Move... We need to wake Alton. We can't stay here. If that woman comes back, we're dead."],["Hayato","Alright. I'll go wake Mr. Alton..."],["Sunny","No. I'll go. He won't listen to you—get Keller. Have the crew pack up. We're pulling out."],["Hayato","Uh... alright."],["","Sunny sprints to his employer's room. Middle of the night be damned—he pounds on the closed door."],["???","Tch. Who's out there?"],["","A voice comes from inside. Sunny pounds harder, ready to kick the door in if it doesn't open now."],["Sunny","Mr. Alton! We've got trouble! We need to leave, now!"],["","The door finally creaks open."],["Alton","Sunny? What's going on?"],["Sunny","Uh... Sorry, Mr. Alton. Here's the situation: we're picking up a large number of unidentified ST signatures closing in. Odds are they're coming for us."],["Alton","What?!"],["Sunny","We can handle them, sure, but you've got an important meeting tomorrow... I figure we'd better not invite extra trouble."],["Alton","This is Sema Town! Barton and I have practically closed the deal. Who'd come all this way just to make trouble for me?!"],["","Sunny's heart clenches. If Alton orders a full investigation, they're finished. He changes the subject fast."],["Sunny","That's Sema Town for you. Fights never stop. Maybe they just stumbled onto us."],["Sunny","Don't worry, Mr. Alton. I've already secured a fallback point. We can lie low there. You still have to meet Mr. Barton tomorrow—you should get some rest tonight."],["Alton","And those people...?"],["Sunny","We'll leave a squad behind to get to the bottom of it. You'll have a full report once we know what happened."],["Alton","Tch... Fine, fine. Let's go."],["","Sunny lets out a long breath, then hurries after Alton to collect his luggage."],["","On the way out, a white glint catches the corner of Sunny's eye. Something feels off. He steps closer—and finds only shattered glass across the floor."],["Sunny","What the hell...? What's catching the light...?"],["Keller","Sunny? Ready? We can go."],["Sunny","Yeah, yeah! Coming!"],["","Sunny shoulders the luggage and hurries away."]],"468357101":[["Michaela","Four... Four in the morning, man..."],["","Michaela stares dead ahead, mechanically shoving muffins into her mouth."],["Gutzman","We're going to miss them. Pack up."],["","Michaela rakes a hand through her hair, irritated, and swallows her breakfast half-chewed."],["Michaela","I said the job was urgent. I didn't say four-in-the-damn-morning urgent. We rushed all day and still didn't reach this hellhole until last night... Tch. Sema Town..."],["","She scrubs a hand over her face and gets up. Gutzman is checking his gear with a scowl. She thinks for a moment, then tries to smooth things over."],["Michaela","Hey, listen. We don't need to rush. I've got it figured out—the key is Barton! We squeeze the truth out of him, find out what that fake \"Alton Brown\" is really after, and the whole mess solves itself."],["Gutzman","Barton Stewart... Heh. He won't be impressed by your record. You expect him to hand you the truth?"],["Michaela","So what? Ha! He may not value me. He values breathing."],["Gutzman","......"],["Gutzman","Bravado works better when it respects reality. We're on his turf."],["Michaela","...Heh-heh. Advisor, I trust that brain of yours. You'll find a way to pry something out of him—"],["","Gutzman's hand stills on his holster. He looks at Michaela. Fresh from bed, her hair makes her look like a golden-maned lion, and she's baring her teeth at him with wicked intent."],["Gutzman","If you're determined to use this plan, I do have one workable suggestion."],["Michaela","Knew it—"],["Gutzman","Pressure Barton in our employer's name. Tell him that if he refuses, every GSA agent will descend on Sema Town and tear his operation apart."],["Michaela","Hmm..."],["","Michaela folds her arms and considers it."],["","Gutzman finishes checking his gear. When Michaela stays silent, he decides to admit it was a joke. First, though, they need to move—before Alton's ST evacuation trail goes cold..."],["Gutzman","Say..."],["Michaela","\"Barton Stewart insulted Madam. Requesting authorization to deploy all combat assets and wipe out every force under his command.\" Think the boss will approve that?"],["Gutzman","..."],["","Gutzman clicks his tongue, bends to retrieve Michaela's tactical belt, and throws it at her."],["Gutzman","Stop dreaming. Move. Alton's getting farther away."],["Michaela","What did you say?!"],["","Dawn burns red across the horizon. Michaela's ST unit is already assembled."],["","She vaults into Mithril, boots the system, rakes her hair into a rough bundle, and ties it off with an elastic cord."],["Michaela","Wait. How much have you been hiding from me? We only got here last night. A few hours later, and you've already found the target?"],["Gutzman","While you were drinking the bar dry, my people were already spread across town gathering intel. They got lucky. Saw something important."],["Michaela","Wh-What?"],["Gutzman","We aren't the only ones looking for Alton. Another group clashed with his bodyguards last night. My people followed them to Alton's hideout and overheard plans to relocate."],["Michaela","Another group? Who? Didn't the boss give this job to us alone?"],["Gutzman","...Unknown. It was dark, and my people kept their distance to avoid detection. All they saw was the leader covered from head to toe."],["Michaela","That scared of being recognized? How many people want them dead?"],["Gutzman","Sema Town is crowded, and gossip travels fast. Wanting to stay anonymous is normal. You, on the other hand..."],["Michaela","What about me? I had a few drinks. Do you have to make every other sentence a lecture?"],["Michaela","Everyone's got a hobby. You slept in the woods during a mission a few days ago, and I didn't say a thing. Mutual understanding, yeah?"],["Michaela","Besides, I'm not scared of anyone coming for revenge. I'll just beat them into line again!"],["Gutzman","......"],["Gutzman","Enough. Let's move. Follow the markers and we should catch them."],["Michaela","*yawning* Yeah, yeah... got it. I'll make sure that guy's dealt with. Properly."],["","Vrrrrm—"],["","Mithril's electronic eyes flare blue. Under Michaela's control, the ST surges into the distance."],["Keller","Mr. Alton, we've reached the designated location. We should have lost the enemy. You can rest easy."],["Alton","Of course—kzzzt—change course—kzzzt—meet Barton—"],["","The voice breaks apart over the channel. Irritation deepens the sorrow lines on Keller's face."],["","He fine-tunes the signal band and opens the channel again."],["Keller","Sorry, Mr. Alton. The signal cut out. Could you repeat—"],["","A spear of light races straight at Keller. A rail gun shot from the distance. Before he can react, the ST beside him lunges in and shoves him clear."],["Keller Mercenary","Boss! Look out!!!"],["","BOOM!!"],["","The blast punches straight through the cockpit. Keller's eyes widen as his subordinate's ST erupts before him."],["Keller","Who the hell—?!"],["","Huh? I missed?"],["","Kong's electronic eyes snap toward the voice. Two STs stand in the distance. One—Mithril—is already charging at him."],["Michaela","Whew, made it... Is Alton Brown with you? Come out, stretch your legs. Let's talk."],["Keller","You bastard—"],["","Kong brings its gun up to fire, then sees what Mithril brought with her—more STs are pouring in behind her."],["","No question. It's a planned ambush."],["Keller","What do you want?"],["Michaela","I just told you. Alton Brown. We want a word."],["Keller","...He's... my employer. What do you want with him?"],["Michaela","Ha. Long story—"],["Michaela","You didn't hear? A while back, Sema Town picked up signals from a communications network the NDF used extensively during the Milkhama War."],["Michaela","Once we cracked the traffic, we found records of a backroom deal between our illustrious Mr. Barton and a veteran politician from the UNCS mainland—Alton Brown."],["Keller","......"],["Michaela","Normally, that's none of our business. The problem is..."],["Michaela","The Net has a detailed file on \"Alton Brown,\" but his identity appears in none of the classified records where it should exist."],["Michaela","Ha! He knows the NDF communications network inside out, yet even the GSA... Ahem. Yet nobody can confirm who he really is—"],["Michaela","Mr. Alton has a lot of secrets. Enough to make my employer nervous."],["Michaela","Now you understand the weight on my shoulders, right?"],["Keller","...None of that concerns me."],["Keller","Everyone on this island has secrets. I'm a mercenary paid to do a job, and I have my own duty."],["Michaela","Good. I like your principles. Let's see how far you'll go for your employer!"]],"468357301":[["Michaela","Ha! That's enough. I don't enjoy slaughtering losers. This fight's already over—"],["Michaela","I'll be taking your employer!"],["","Bang!"],["","Michaela fires one last shot. Kong's right arm blows apart, leaving it unable to fight back."],["Michaela","All of you! Check every cockpit. If anyone matches the target, bring him to me!"],["","Acknowledgments flood the channel. Michaela nods, satisfied."],["Michaela","Well? Why don't you climb out? We can talk."],["Keller","......"],["Keller","Who the hell are you?"],["Michaela","Michaela. And you? What's your name?"],["Keller","...Keller."],["Michaela","Alright, Keller. You've got some skill. Ever think of running with a different crew?"],["Keller","...Are you asking me to join you?"],["Michaela","Was I not obvious enough?"],["","A sigh comes over the channel."],["Keller","You'll regret that offer soon enough."],["Michaela","Ha. When I give my word—"],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss! These guys all look like mercs, same as us! Doesn't look like our target's here."],["Michaela","How's that possible?! Did you search properly?"],["Michaela Mercenary","Well... I rounded everyone up. Come down and see for yourself, Boss."],["","Michaela glares at Keller. He meets her gaze with a deep frown."],["","Footsteps sound nearby. Gutzman approaches at an easy pace."],["Gutzman","I've checked every one. None of them matches our target. They're all ordinary mercenaries."],["Michaela","......"],["Michaela","You've got some nerve, Keller. You play me, then stare me down like you've done nothing wrong."],["Keller","...It's just my face. I was born this way."],["Michaela","Talk. Where's Alton?"],["Keller","Honestly, I don't know."],["","Michaela draws the pistol at her waist. She glances at Keller, then starts cleaning it."],["Michaela","You didn't discuss the plan before the operation?"],["Keller","We did. I only knew my part."],["Michaela","And your part was what? Draw their attention?"],["Keller","...Yes. After that, I know nothing."],["","Michaela arches a brow and clicks off the safety. Keller doesn't so much as blink."],["Michaela","Alright. You've got guts."],["","Michaela shoots Gutzman a sidelong look. His turn."],["","Keller sounds perfectly at ease. Is he really fearless, or only pretending? Michaela can't tell. What she does know is that he's their quickest lead to Alton."],["","Gutzman steps forward, doing his best to look friendly."],["Gutzman","We used to—"],["Keller","We've never met."],["Gutzman","...Right. But I've heard your name, back when you ran with Sámi."],["","A flicker crosses Keller's face. He looks away."],["Gutzman","Heard you pulled a hell of a job and even tangled with The Ashes... Couldn't have been an easy fight, huh?"],["Keller","What do you mean?"],["Gutzman","Heh."],["","Gutzman grins, pulls a pack of smokes from his pocket, lights one for himself, then another for Keller."],["","Keller watches the orange ember for two seconds before taking the cigarette between his fingers."],["","Michaela's brow knots at the sight. For the sake of the job, she keeps her mouth shut and simply edges a few steps away in disgust."],["Gutzman","Look... I'm just saying, nobody has it easy on this island. We work ourselves half to death just to scrape by—and the moment we get a little ambitious, they drag us off to a cell."],["Gutzman","But without ambition, what are we? Idiots who do nothing but eat, drink, piss, and shit?"],["Keller","...What's your point?"],["Gutzman","You're getting impatient because you think I'm cozying up to you, trying to coax Alton's location out of you. Me? I'm just giving you the truth."],["Gutzman","And the truth is, once we're in Milkhama, we've got no choice but to claw our way toward a better life. Put everyone else's interests first, and you'll end up as another rung on their ladder."],["","Gutzman takes a long drag, then slowly exhales."],["Gutzman","How much is Alton paying you for this job? Heh... Don't suppose you'll give me the number, but there's one thing we both know."],["Gutzman","Your contract isn't over. The rest of your fee hasn't hit your account yet, has it?"],["Keller","...It is over. He paid me in full before I left."],["Gutzman","Oh? Ha-ha. Shall we wait and see if a small fortune suddenly lands in your account?"],["Keller","......"],["","At last, Keller's expression shifts. The furrow between his brows deepens. Gutzman has hit a nerve."],["Gutzman","Heh. There it is—your contract's still open. And unless you're an idiot, you've arranged to meet Alton and collect the balance once the job is done."],["Gutzman","Too bad, Mr. Keller. You're not going anywhere now. Unless you let us tag along when you collect, that money will never see the inside of your account."],["","The clouds on Michaela's face finally lift. She strides over, laughing."],["Michaela","Right! Then we'll catch Alton sooner or later—wait. If he realizes you're the one who got him caught, there's no way he'll cough up the other half, is there?"],["Michaela","Tsk. Oh, Gutzman... The way you tell it, poor Keller's future looks downright bleak."],["Gutzman","No. I can offer him a deal where he can't lose."],["Michaela","Huh?"],["Gutzman","Whatever Alton is paying you, we'll triple it. One condition... You lead us to him. Deal?"],["Michaela","T-Triple?!"],["","Michaela's eyes go wide. Her voice drops at once."],["Michaela","*mumbling* Who's covering this? You or me?"],["Gutzman","...We do have a mission budget, right?"],["Michaela","*mumbling* ...Then YOU write the report!"],["","Keller watches them whisper back and forth, face dark, numbers already turning over in his head."],["","At last, he drags a hand down his face and catches the nearly spent cigarette between his teeth."],["Keller","What you said about Alton... Is it true?"],["Michaela","...Huh?"],["Keller","—That he's no politician. Just a con man."],["Michaela","Tsk... Well, you can always come with us and see for yourself, can't you?"],["Alton","Keller's been dark for an hour. Think something happened?"],["Sunny","He's tough. He'll be fine. He probably got dragged into some local trouble while investigating and hasn't had time to answer."],["Alton","Let's hope so."],["Alton","We need to hurry back to town, even if we have to take the long way around. It's almost time to meet Barton."],["Sunny","I know. Hayato, take point and clear us a path. I'll cover the rear."],["Hayato","Got it."],["","The squad of STs tears across the sand."],["","Sunny tries to hail Kong, but every call is rejected."],["Sunny","What's going on? All we asked was for him to switch routes and fake an investigation so Alton wouldn't get suspicious. How the hell did he go dark?"],["Sunny","Tch... Don't tell me he ran into that bitch."],["","A bad feeling creeps over Sunny, but the whole thing still makes no sense. For the life of him, he can't figure out what that woman wants."],["Sunny","Why the hell is she hounding us like this? It doesn't add up..."],["Hayato","Sunny, we've got trouble! A whole pack of STs just showed up ahead. What do we do?"],["Sunny","Is it that wo... Ahem. Is it you-know-who?"],["Hayato","Not from the ST models. But we haven't tangled with this crew before, either."],["","Sunny breathes a quiet sigh of relief."],["Sunny","Don't provoke them. Maybe they're just passing through. We'll take another route..."],["Alton","We can't! Another detour and we'll miss the meeting. Sunny, enough. Time to clear these roadblocks."],["Sunny","This..."],["Guard Member","Identify yourselves. What business do you have in Sankara?"],["Hayato","Sunny, they're with Sankara!"],["Sunny","You think I haven't figured that out?!"],["Guard Member","No one wants to answer? Then I suppose we'll have to keep you here and talk at our leisure—"],["","Cold sweat beads across Sunny's brow. Their current force doesn't stand a chance against Sankara's people, but Alton isn't about to back down. What the hell is he supposed to do?"],["","Fight? Or..."],["Alton","Wait! We're Mr. Barton's guests! You have no right to detain us!"],["Guard Member","Ha! Barton doesn't scare us that much. These are unusual times, so blame yourselves for coming here... Boys, invite our guests out for a little chat!"],["","—No! No fighting!!"],["","Sunny falls back without a moment's hesitation. Almost at once, gunfire and explosions erupt behind him."],["Hayato","Sunny! What do we do?!"],["Sunny","Hold them off! I'll find Keller and bring back help! Just hold on!! I'll be back!"],["Hayato","Sunny—!"],["Alton","Sunny!! You're deserting us in the middle of a fight?!!"],["","Sunny's scalp prickles. He cuts the comms without hesitation. He's bringing up the rear, and the fighting hasn't reached him yet. At maximum output, Twilight Fang all but vanishes into the distance."]],"468361101":[["","Twilight Fang finally sputters out at the gates of Sema Town and grinds to a halt."],["","The cockpit hatch barely opens before Sunny leaps out and bolts for the town center, bowling over pedestrians and leaving a trail of curses behind him."],["Sunny","Out of the way! Lives are on the line!"],["","Gasping for breath, Sunny reaches the grandest building in the town center: Barton's residence."],["","He checks the time. Perfect. By running Twilight Fang flat-out, he's made it back to Sema Town early. Barton shouldn't have left yet."],["Sunny","Huff... huff... huff... A-Anyone... Anyone there? I... I'm here on behalf of my employer... to see Mr. Barton!"],["","The doors remain firmly shut. Puzzled, Sunny calls out again."],["Sunny","Anyone there? I'm—"],["","Sunny... Been a long time."],["Sunny","!?"],["","Sunny freezes, rifling through his memory for the voice. Then recognition hits. His eyes fly wide, every hair on his body stands on end, and he bolts!"],["","Bang!"],["","A gunshot cracks over his head. A bullet hole appears beside the toe of his boot. Impeccable control."],["","I've made a new friend and run into an old one. Must be my lucky day."],["","At the more familiar voice, Sunny's chest tightens. He looks up. A red-haired woman he doesn't recognize has a gun trained on him, a faint smile on her lips."],["","...Damn it. These devils took Barton's base!"],["","Sunny forces a smile and throws both hands up."],["Sunny","Yeah, old friend. Maybe it's time we caught up. I happen to know a few things... Things I think you'll find very interesting."],["","That woman... Am I seeing things? She looks just like Georgia..."],["","No way. What would Georgia be doing here...? Wait. She really does look like her!"],["","Georgia? Sunny freezes. The name is maddeningly familiar. Damn it, think! Who the hell is she?!"],["","Georgia sweeps a glance over the whispering mercenaries, then tips her gun toward Sunny."],["Georgia","Inside. We don't have much time."],["","The room is a makeshift interrogation room."],["","Alton has been sitting here for half an hour. The guard at the door lets him move around, but won't let him leave."],["","When he's first brought in, he tries talking to the guard, but even after talking himself hoarse, he gets nothing useful in return. Eventually, he gives up."],["","Just as he closes his eyes to rest, the door opens again. This time, a new face steps in."],["Aiden","I hear you've been asking to see me."],["Alton","You're... the one in charge here?"],["Aiden","I am. Aiden. Aiden Grimwald. And you are?"],["Alton","Alton. Alton Brown."],["","Alton answers warily. Aiden strolls toward him, relaxed and light on his feet, yet something about the man sets Alton's nerves on edge."],["Aiden","You're from off-island, aren't you?"],["Alton","That's right. We came to the island looking for a few business opportunities... If we've caused offense by entering Sankara territory unannounced, you have my apologies."],["","Aiden smiles, as though he expected exactly that answer."],["Aiden","Very well, Mr. Alton. I appreciate the candor, so I'll get straight to the point."],["Aiden","Sema Town occupies a peculiar position. Most who settle there are vicious criminals beholden to no power on the island. To us, they've always been a potential threat."],["Alton","Yet as far as I know, Mr. Barton has no intention of making an enemy of you."],["Aiden","No one can see into another man's heart. How can you be sure he means it?"],["Alton","......"],["Aiden","Heh. I'm only taking one extra precaution, Mr. Alton. I hear your talks with Barton went well. Care to tell me what sort of arrangement you reached?"],["","Alton's gaze brushes the gun at Aiden's hip before he answers, hesitant."],["Alton","Rest assured, our arrangement poses no threat to Sankara's interests."],["Aiden","As I said, no one can see into another man's heart... There are matters I need to clarify. Our modest intelligence network can't uncover your identity, Mr. Alton. Naturally, that makes me curious..."],["Aiden","Which faction do you represent in your dealings with Barton?"],["Alton","I just..."],["","Alton instinctively reaches for his prepared lie. Then he sees Aiden's still-friendly smile, and his heart gives a heavy thud. The question is a trap."],["","—If he claims to be an ordinary man, Aiden can kill him here without a second thought. Even buying Aiden off would likely cost more than Alton could ever afford."],["","If he admits he's from the UNCS mainland, Aiden's caution and sharp instincts will almost certainly mark him as an enemy. He'll be detained while they dig into his true purpose in Milkhama."],["","Then what if he claims to be from the Dawnstar League...? No. Vesper, the voice of Milkhama's people, is still branded a terrorist organization by the League. If Aiden has any connection to Vesper, that lie is suicide."],["","What if he says he's from somewhere like Obsidian or Doll? Hmm..."],["Aiden","Is there something you find difficult to say, Mr. Alton? Or has the recent battle left you so mentally exhausted that your memory management is starting to fail?"],["Alton","...The truth is, my origins are highly classified. Revealing them to anyone without clearance would bring trouble neither of us wants."],["","Alton falls silent for a moment, then chooses a phrasing calculated to make Aiden think twice."],["Aiden","Worse than being trapped here with your life under threat?"],["","Alton hears the threat beneath the words, but he has nowhere left to retreat."],["Alton","Of course. I'm not the only person it would involve."],["Aiden","......"],["","Aiden studies him, weighing whether the claim holds together."],["Guard Member","Boss, quick heads-up. A group just showed up asking for the guy we caught. You might want to come take a look."],["","Aiden taps his earpiece twice in acknowledgment, signals the guard to watch Alton, then leaves."],["Georgia","You're sure they're all from Sankara?"],["Sunny","The guy who spoke to us just now is the same one who ordered us out before. I'd know that voice anywhere. Sankara or not, my employer is definitely in their hands."],["Georgia Mercenary","He'd better be, Sunny. If you've lied to my boss, you'll learn what it means to wish you were dead."],["Sunny","Uh, heh-heh... Let's not get ahead of ourselves. We can all calm down and talk this through. No need to get worked up."],["Sunny","Look, Boss Georgia, if you'd told us who you were sooner, we might've avoided all those little misunderstandings. I'd have shown you proper respect..."],["Georgia","Sunny."],["","Georgia cuts him off. A rush of footsteps approaches. Aiden advances with a squad of guards, then stops well short of Georgia."],["Georgia","A pleasure, friend of Sankara. I'm Georgia, leader of the Iguana Mercenary Group."],["Aiden","Ah... I'm Aiden, of the Sankara Guard. To my knowledge, we have no dealings with the Iguana Mercenary Group. What brings you here today?"],["Georgia","I made my purpose perfectly clear to the man beside you. I hope you aren't avoiding the matter just so you can refuse me."],["Aiden","......"],["","Aiden doesn't expect Georgia to be so blunt. She leaves him no room to dance around the issue."],["Aiden","What is Alton to you?"],["Georgia","He's my target. Unless you have blood of your own to settle with him, hand him over."],["Aiden","And if I refuse?"],["Georgia","...Then what is Alton to you, Mr. Aiden?"],["Aiden","For now, I need him in my custody until my concerns are resolved. If you're in no hurry, you're welcome to wait in town."],["","Georgia arches a brow as possibilities race through her mind."],["Georgia","Heh... Aiden, a mercenary's time is precious."],["Aiden","Mercenaries have things more precious than time... I was one myself, Georgia. I understand."],["Georgia","Really...?"],["","The corner of Georgia's mouth curls. She slowly turns to leave."],["Georgia","...Aiden. What do you make of Vesper?"],["","The question comes from nowhere. Aiden's guard goes up."],["Aiden","If you want Vesper's story, the news still runs special reports. I'm a rough man and no storyteller. I doubt I'd do it justice."],["Georgia","...Alright."],["","Georgia strides forward, calm and resolute."],["","Without warning, she clicks her heels together twice and stops."],["Georgia","Let's do this."],["","*BOOM——*"],["","The ground convulses. Blasts shear loose every rock on the mountaintop, sending them hammering onto the makeshift safehouse. Under the impact, the roof begins to cave in."],["Guard Member","We're under attack! It's them! Open fire! Fire!!"],["Aiden","No! Get down—!!"],["","A beam gathers at the far edge of their vision, swelling into a blinding glare. Aiden hugs the ground and catches a hazy glimpse of a red figure still running... At the end of her path stands an imposing ST, twin blades in hand."]],"468361301":[["","Aiden kicks the cockpit hatch open. Fresh air floods in, giving his reeling head a moment's relief."],["","He looks up calmly. The point of Blue Bird's blade hangs less than two meters from his skull. Georgia needs only move a finger to take his head."],["","He has no choice. Dopplesoldner has taken too much damage to function, and if he stays inside, he'll suffocate in the cockpit."],["Georgia","Changed your mind?"],["Aiden","......"],["","Aiden grits his teeth."],["Georgia","I don't want Sankara as an enemy. But if you insist on obstructing my mission, I'll have no choice but to take the risk and change my approach."],["Aiden","I don't want to fight you either, Georgia. I received intelligence that a powerful figure of unknown identity has arrived in Sema Town."],["Aiden","Sankara hasn't known peace since Vesper appeared. Then this man arrives on our doorstep and tries to collude with the biggest mercenary force in the area..."],["Aiden","I don't know what they're planning. But if they mean Sankara harm... none of us can afford the consequences."],["Georgia","......"],["Aiden","You don't have to understand my position. Until I know Alton poses no threat to us, you cannot take him."],["Aiden","Kill me and the Guard still won't yield. They know the one thing that matters most: protecting their families and friends."],["","Aiden's jaw works. He's already made peace with death. Fear claws at him, but he forces himself to face Georgia's blade."],["Aiden","Alton has already been moved. You won't find him... You lose all the same, Georgia."],["Georgia","......"],["","Blue Bird's electronic eye flickers. For a moment, only the faint hiss of static comes through its speakers."],["","Hssss... Blue Bird's cockpit hatch slowly opens. Aiden gradually makes out the red-haired woman's cool, impassive face."],["","Georgia vaults from the cockpit rim and lands with clean precision on the spine of Blue Bird's blade. She crouches and studies Aiden."],["Georgia","Winning means nothing. Staying alive is what matters."],["Aiden","Staying alive means nothing either. Creating value, whether in life or death... That's what matters."],["Georgia","Heh."],["","Georgia gives a faint smile. A dim spark glints in her eyes."],["Georgia","You're right, Aiden. Which is why I'm warning you: if you don't hand over Alton, you and Sankara will face far greater trouble."]],"468365101":[["Michaela","Hey, hey. We came all this way. You aren't still trying to con us, are you?"],["","Keller ignores Michaela. He crouches and presses a hand to the sand."],["","Michaela pulls off one glove and fans herself. The sand before her is scorched black, shell casings strewn everywhere. It doesn't take a genius to see a fierce battle was fought here."],["Keller","The last transmission came from somewhere nearby... They may have been attacked."],["Michaela","Don't care, big guy. The deposit's already been wired. I want them found, dead or alive. So what's the move?"],["Keller","......"],["","Keller studies her in silence, then pulls out his communicator and calls a number—"],["","......"],["","......"],["","The call doesn't connect. Undeterred, Keller tries another number and sends a second request."],["","......"],["","Bzzzt—"],["","What the hell are you doing?! Didn't I tell you never to use this channel unless lives were on the line?!"],["","Keller glances at Michaela and clears his throat."],["Keller","Where did you go? I followed the signal, but no one was there—Sunny, who attacked you?"],["Sunny","What?! You're still at that godforsaken place? Move, move! That's Sankara territory. If the Guard catches you, you're screwed."],["Keller","Sankara?"],["","Keller freezes. He glances at Michaela and Gutzman, then signals everyone back to their STs. They need to leave. Now."],["","Keller switches to the open channel so Michaela and Gutzman can hear Sunny too."],["Sunny","Who else? Those people are wound way too tight. One wrong word and they start shooting. Alton... Ahem. We got into a fight with them."],["Keller","Where are you now? I... I'll come to you."],["Sunny","Really?! Then get over here! We... we're short-handed!"],["Keller","Give me the situation. I need to know what I'm walking into."],["Sunny","Uh..."],["Keller","Sunny?"],["Sunny","Nothing. It's perfectly safe here. Come on over. I'll send the coordinates."],["","Keller falls silent. Something doesn't add up."],["","If Sunny and the others are perfectly safe, why didn't they contact him sooner? Why did Keller have to use the backup encrypted channel just to reach them?"],["","—Something beyond Sunny's control has happened. He has no choice but to tread carefully."],["Keller","Didn't you say you got into a fight with Sankara's people? How'd it go?"],["Sunny","Uh... well, someone stepped in. Sankara's people have backed off for now, and they're negotiating what happens next."],["Sunny","Our employer needs us now. Get the team ready and hurry over. Even if we can't beat them, we can at least make a show of force."],["Keller","Who helped you?"],["Sunny","Georgia! You know her, right? She's pretty famous—the red-haired devil..."],["","The comm channel erupts in a piercing whine. Sunny claps a hand over the receiver, but it's too late."],["Sunny","Gah! What the hell was that noise?!"],["Keller","...Nothing. I hit the wrong control and messed with the comm interface—that's all. I'm on my way. Keep an eye on the employer."],["","With a beep, Keller cuts the connection."],["Michaela","Tsk, tsk, tsk. Did I hear that right? Gutzman, you catch that?"],["Gutzman","......"],["Michaela","Ha! Is today finally the showdown I've been waiting for?"],["Gutzman","...What's she doing here?"],["","Michaela can't read Gutzman's mood, but she can't resist prodding him. Maybe her adviser will finally give her an interesting reaction."],["Michaela","Who knows? Milkhama's a small place. Lovers or enemies, nobody has to worry about missing each other. Everyone meets again eventually."],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman draws a deep breath. Long-buried memories stir, and Georgia's blade is at his brow again. His hand tightens around the controls, trembling almost imperceptibly for one fleeting instant."],["","Is it fear or excitement? Perhaps neither... perhaps both."],["Gutzman","No time to waste... Let's move."],["Michaela","Easy. Sure, I'm dying for a real fight with Georgia, but there's still something off about this."],["Michaela","Hey, Keller. Your pal was stumbling all over himself on comms. You sure we can trust him?"],["Keller","We've worked together a few times. That doesn't make us \"brothers.\" He may be lying—Sunny only ever looks out for himself... but he knows something we don't. We should go."],["Gutzman","If it really is Georgia, we'd better be ready for her."],["Michaela","Hm? Fine by me. As long as you don't switch sides out of nowhere, she shouldn't be too hard to handle."],["Gutzman","...Heh."],["Michaela","Not bad, Gutzman. I can hear something almost like fire in that laugh. Looks like you're finally ready to face the shadow Georgia left hanging over you—"],["Gutzman","I once drove her to the brink. She was wounded, stranded in an empty stretch of desert with no supplies. Her odds of survival were almost nil."],["Michaela","But she survived."],["Gutzman","Yes. Which means there was a variable I failed to account for... a path to survival I never imagined."],["Gutzman","After meeting you, I realized she might be like you. Maybe she, too, has an immovable power at her back—one capable of sheltering her beyond all expectation when crisis strikes..."],["Gutzman","I didn't lose to her alone. I lost to everything she represents... Don't underestimate her. That's my advice."],["Michaela","......"],["Michaela","Damn... You've got me dying to meet her now. If it isn't Georgia, I'm going to be seriously disappointed."],["Gutzman","Then enough talk. We'll confirm it ourselves."],["","At the Iguana base..."],["","Georgia tosses her sidearm onto the table, ties back her long hair, then twists open a bottle of water and drains it."],["Georgia","Alton's already on his way here, right?"],["Aiden","Yes. I've shared these coordinates over the team channel."],["Georgia","Good. Take a breather—help yourself to food and water."],["","Aiden's gaze shifts to the sidearm Georgia left on the table."],["Georgia","But don't get any ideas. From the moment you walked in, I've accounted for every move you could make. I hope you stick to the ones that end well for both of us."],["Aiden","......"],["Aiden","What did you mean earlier? Who is Alton, really? How could his presence bring even more trouble to Sankara?"],["Georgia","Because of Vesper."],["Aiden","...What do you mean?"],["Georgia","The DLAF has only just quelled the storm Vesper stirred up across East Milkhama. Right now, they're hypersensitive to the slightest sign of resistance activity."],["Aiden","Vesper... They've already paid the price—"],["","Aiden clenches his fists, teeth grinding."],["Aiden","But Sankara is full of civilians who can't defend themselves! They just want to live in peace! Why does the League keep tightening the noose?!"],["Georgia","So you really have no idea who Alton is... He's a veteran politician from the UNCS mainland."],["Aiden","What?"],["Georgia","If he and the political forces behind him intend to use Sankara as a foothold to split East Milkhama apart again, you can imagine how the DLAF brass will react."],["Georgia","Heh. Once suspicion falls on Sankara, any accusation, no matter how baseless, will be enough to make your situation even worse."],["Aiden","......"],["","Aiden goes still."],["Georgia","So handing this hot potato to me is your best move—right?"],["Aiden","......"],["Aiden","And you? Who are you, and how do you know all this?"],["Georgia","The job demanded it. I learned what I needed to. Don't be nosy."],["Georgia Mercenary","Kzzzt—Boss, we've got trouble! Sunny slipped our coordinates out behind our backs!"],["Georgia","Where is he? Bring him to me."],["Georgia Mercenary","I... S-Sorry, Boss. We lost him. That bastard's slippery—he faked food poisoning, threw us off, then made a run for it!"],["Georgia","......"],["","Georgia sighs and thinks for a moment."],["Georgia","We're in the city. If they make a move, it won't be quiet. Pull everyone out of the base and widen the surveillance perimeter."],["Georgia Mercenary","Got it!"],["Aiden","Georgia... My people won't help you."],["Georgia","No matter. For now, just be good prisoners."],["","A wall of flame fills Georgia's binoculars. Black smoke boils upward as people flee in every direction."],["Georgia Mercenary","Boss, just as you predicted—they went straight for our base."],["Georgia","Do we have the missile launch coordinates?"],["Georgia Mercenary","Marked and synced to your terminal."],["","Georgia glances down and commits the location to memory."],["Georgia Mercenary","What do we do next?"],["Georgia","Sunny escaped, but they attacked anyway. That means they may not be after Sunny."],["Georgia Mercenary","Boss, you mean...?"],["Georgia","Heh. Looks like the esteemed Mr. Alton has no shortage of loyal hounds."],["Georgia Mercenary","That politician...?"],["Georgia","Pass the order. Execute Emergency Plan Five. Don't get tangled up with them—we're taking Alton and getting out."],["Georgia Mercenary","Got it, Boss. Per the plan's calculations, our next rendezvous is ER07."],["Georgia","Move."],["Georgia Mercenary","Yes, Boss! Stay safe. See you soon."],["","Georgia stows the communicator and slips nimbly back into Blue Bird's cockpit."],["","The massive ST rises with a deepening hum. Within seconds, it's fully charged and leads a small ST squad swiftly away from the shelter."],["","During the withdrawal, Georgia receives a long-range comm request from Aiden."],["Aiden","Georgia, Alton will rendezvous with us as planned. My people are bringing him now."],["Georgia","ER07. Remember those coordinates. I'm almost there—"],["","An ST suddenly fills Georgia's view. She pauses, then brings Blue Bird to a halt."],["Aiden","Kzzzt—...—kzzzt—watch out—kzzzt—"],["Aiden","Kzzzt—kzzzt—kzzzt—"],["","Powerful electromagnetic interference drowns the comm channel in static."],["","Georgia cuts the comms and calmly studies the monitor. A Malthus stands there, twin blades in hand, perfectly still—as if it has been waiting for her all along."],["","Has her plan been exposed? Is there a traitor in her ranks? Or... has every step she takes been anticipated from the start?"],["","Blue Bird shifts its blade into a reverse grip and advances, unhurried."],["Georgia","A few words first, or do we start now?"],["","...It really is you."],["","Georgia's ear twitches. A name rises to her lips."],["","...Georgia... It really is... you."],["","Georgia smiles, the corner of her mouth curling with delighted anticipation."],["Georgia","Catching me here with this kind of precision... Gutzman, looks like you haven't forgotten a thing Iguana taught you."],["Gutzman","Forget? I relive it every second."],["","He remembers the helpless rage inside Hades' cockpit. Rex hunting him like a phantom. The red silhouette receding into the yellow sands. The bullet he never fired."],["","Each memory is a nightmare with its hands around his throat."],["Georgia","Heh. So your friends are the ones who blew up my base?"],["Gutzman","How else could I make you trigger Emergency Plan Five?"],["Georgia","...Good. Very good."],["","Blue Bird sinks into a low stance, its left arm leveling the blade. Light pulses through its electronic eye."],["Georgia","You've gone to all this trouble, so I assume you're ready for anything. Any last words? I have somewhere to be—let's make this quick."],["Gutzman","Finding you here is a bitter disappointment. You haven't changed at all, Georgia."],["Georgia","You, on the other hand, aren't the man you used to be, Gutzman. I never thought I'd see you take up a blade—is that something you prepared for today?"],["Gutzman","You'll find out soon enough."]],"468365301":[["Gutzman","Ge—or—gi—a!!!"],["","Gutzman roars as he drives the control stick forward, throwing his whole body into it as though bracing against a boulder hurtling down a mountainside."],["","With two heavy clangs, his blade crashes hard against Georgia's. He thumbs the button inside the control lever, and Malthus's right shoulder shudders as it readies its final missile."],["Georgia","Heh. Your turn to go to hell—"],["","Georgia gives a cold laugh. Blue Bird whips its blade back and punches it through Malthus's right shoulder. The glowing orange launcher goes dark in an instant."],["","Blue Bird eases off, adjusts the angle, and resets its grip. With enough output, the next strike will cleave straight through Malthus's cockpit—"],["Aiden","Kzzzt—Geo—kzzzt—Geor—kzzzt—Georgia! Georgia! They're trying to take Alton!"],["Aiden","Georgia?! Can you hear me?! We're under attack! They're trying to take Alton! Get over here, now!"],["Georgia","!?"],["","Blue Bird freezes mid-motion."],["Georgia","So you really are here for Alton... I underestimated you."],["Gutzman","Alton? Hearing that name from you only makes this more disappointing. What does he have to do with you?"],["Georgia","...You'll get your chance to find out."],["","Coordinates: ER07."],["Aiden","Where the hell did Georgia go?! This is bad—they've got too much firepower! We can't hold them forever!"],["Georgia Mercenary","Then we hold until the bitter end! Boss will be here any second!"],["Aiden","I'm not letting my people die here for nothing! Listen to me—we pull back now and find another way to rendezvous with Georgia!"],["Georgia Mercenary","No! How do we know you're not using this chance to run?! Hold on a little longer. Boss will—"],["","The words have barely left his mouth when a red contact racing toward them appears on both sensors. Each time it passes through the enemy line, another signal vanishes from the screen."],["Georgia Mercenary","It's Boss!!"],["","Blue Bird cuts a path straight into the heart of the battlefield, its blade flashing cold as it bears down on the imposing Mithril."],["Georgia","Stop! I've got Gutzman!"],["Michaela","Oh? Georgia... Is it really you?!"],["","Bang! Bang! Bang!"],["","Michaela's eyes blaze as she unleashes a volley at Blue Bird. Blue Bird snatches up a steel shield from the ground, but each impact drives it farther back."],["Michaela","Ha-ha-ha! Running into you is just too—damn—perfect! Come on! Come on, come on! Give me a real fight!"],["Georgia","Stop! I know you don't believe me—"],["","Blue Bird raises its left hand and slowly opens its palm. Mithril's electronic eye flickers, instantly picking out the bundle of... airbags."],["","With nothing holding them up, the airbags tumble away one by one, revealing Gutzman unconscious at their center from the violent impact. The sight cools Michaela's battle fever a little... She blinks."],["Michaela","Damn... You really do have him. That's so damn cool, you crazy woman..."],["Michaela Mercenary","Confirmed. It's Gutzman. He's in bad shape—obvious external trauma, likely severe internal bleeding. He needs immediate treatment."],["Michaela","Tch... Beaten by the same woman twice. You'd better not have held back just to set this up for me, Counselor..."],["","Michaela murmurs toward Gutzman where he lies in the distance, then strolls over to Georgia."],["Michaela","Hey, Georgia! Did my counselor tell you about his new boss? Ha! You're looking at her—Michaela."],["Georgia","I didn't give him much time to reminisce."],["Michaela","...Tch. Your loss. We've got plenty of great stories between us."],["","Georgia remains expressionless, unmoved."],["Georgia","I'm taking Alton. As for this man—"],["","Georgia lowers her eyes, letting her gaze brush over Gutzman on the ground."],["Georgia","You can take him away."],["Michaela","Huh? Wait, what?!"],["","Michaela is struck speechless."],["Michaela","H-Hey, hold it! That's not how this works. We haven't even settled who's won, and you've already dumped me into the losers' bracket so you can call all the shots?!"],["Georgia","If you don't want him, that's fine. He already owes me his life."],["Michaela","No, no, no, I'll be straight with you. I'm taking both the counselor and Alton. What are you going to do about it?"],["Georgia","......"],["Georgia","I've heard of you, Michaela. You've been making waves out west, bringing several mercenary outfits under your banner."],["Michaela","Aw, you're too kind. Someone as strong as me—"],["Georgia","You've built that kind of momentum without the NDF bringing the hammer down, and you're fielding military-grade hardware... Heh. I doubt I'm looking at some nameless ragtag outfit, am I?"],["Michaela","Hey... Now that you mention it..."],["Georgia","That also explains your obsession with Alton. You're covering for a politician from the UNCS mainland who slipped into Milkhama, making sure his important operation in Sema Town goes off without a hitch... Heh. Not a bad plan."],["Michaela","What?! You've got it all wrong! Alton's clearly—"],["Gutzman","Alton's background... Ahem! It's... classified. How did you find out?"],["","At some point, Gutzman regains consciousness. Aware of his condition, he makes no attempt to move more than necessary. He only locks eyes with Georgia and waits for her answer."],["Gutzman","Why are you... so determined... to take Alton?"],["Georgia","......"],["Gutzman","Because your superiors... want to use Alton's cover to build a new network of assets in West Milkhama?"],["Georgia","......"],["","Gutzman stares hard at Georgia's face. The suspicion he's carried for so long is about to be confirmed. Tense and intent, he searches for the slightest crack in her expression—for the answer he's been chasing—until he almost forgets the agony of his wounds."],["Georgia","Nonsense. Alton is one of yours."],["Michaela","Bullshit! There's no trace of him on the internal network. Someone planted him here to use forged network signals and sabotage NDF operations—someone like you, or your employer."],["Georgia","......"],["","Georgia's brow furrows."],["Georgia","Aiden. Have your people bring Alton here."],["","Aiden signals one of his men with a glance. Soon, a haggard Alton comes into view."],["","The once-impeccable politician looks thoroughly weathered after so long on the run. He stops and surveys the ring of people who very obviously mean trouble. Cold sweat beads across his brow."],["Alton","Who the hell are you people? I'm warning you—don't throw away your li—Aagh!!"],["","A gleaming blade is already pressed to Alton's neck. It bites in and draws a long, thin line of blood."],["Georgia","Good news: we have doubts about your true identity, so you're getting one chance to defend yourself."],["","Alton watches Georgia's hand, terrified she'll slit his throat on the spot."],["Alton","Who... Who are you people? I..."],["Michaela","Hey, hey. You're not the one asking questions right now. Keep playing games and you'll lose your life. Talk—are you with this woman or not?"],["","Georgia's expression darkens as she presses harder."],["Georgia","Tell the truth. Are these people sheltering you so you can carry out operations in East Milkhama?"],["Alton","Aagh! Stop! Don't cut any deeper!"],["Michaela","You know the NDF's classified communications network. Is someone inside the military working with you? Your cover is blown, people are hunting you, and Georgia is supposed to take you somewhere safe—is that it?"],["Alton","I actually—"],["Georgia","Heh. Or is Michaela only pretending to cut ties with you so I'll lower my guard, drop my suspicions, and let you live?"],["Alton","What?!"],["Georgia","Too bad. The stakes are too high. I'd rather kill you now—"],["","Alton's eyes bulge. He immediately shrieks until his face and neck go scarlet."],["Alton","Stop! Let me talk! Let me—!!!"],["Georgia","......"],["Michaela","......"],["Alton","You two lunatics... Huff... Have you even given me a chance to talk?! Huff... huff..."],["Michaela","Then spit it out. I can practically see your veins!"],["Alton","I used to! I-I used to... serve in an NDF communications unit, that's all. Then I got into some trouble and was discharged. I spent years getting nowhere on the mainland. Then I heard Milkhama was full of ways to make money, so... ahem... I came to try my luck."],["Michaela","That's it?! Then why pose as a politician and sneak around?"],["Alton","What do you know?! In this line of work, nothing matters more than a background that opens doors! Why else would anyone let you in on the big money?!"],["Michaela","Ha! Nice fantasy. Shame you never learned to keep your head down, brother. You got kicked out of the military and still used NDF comms right under the GSA's nose? Of course they came after you."],["Alton","...What do you know...? I just forgot to bypass the secure communication protocols. It was one tiny mistake!"],["Michaela","Tsk, tsk, tsk. Still talking tough. No wonder they threw you out."],["Alton","Can you let me go now? I don't have a grudge against any of you! We're all just trying to make our own money..."],["Michaela","Exactly, Georgia. The truth's out. You know which of us he should go with now, don't you?"],["Georgia","......"],["","Georgia gives a cold snort and shoves Alton back. Her people immediately step in and bind him."],["Alton","What are you doing?! We can still talk, Georgia! And you over there... Michaela! We could work together—!"],["Georgia","I don't believe a word of your story. You're coming with me. I have specialists who'll continue this conversation."],["Michaela","What the hell? You're not letting him go? This guy's NDF!"],["Georgia","Was. Now he claims he's a con man. If this is some act the two of you cooked up to fool me... heh. I'm not letting such an obvious liability walk."],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela's face hardens, her hand twitching on the grip of her pistol. But when her gaze brushes Gutzman on the ground, hesitation flickers across her face."],["","Just as her fingers begin to loosen, she meets Gutzman's eyes. She can't read the look in them... but she's seen it before."],["Gutzman","...So the rumors are true. You're from the DLAF... aren't you?"],["","Gutzman struggles to his feet. Georgia pauses, then slowly turns her gaze to his face. She says nothing."],["Gutzman","And Iguana? Is Iguana... another of the DLAF's lapdogs?"],["Georgia","......"],["Gutzman","Ha... ha-ha... So it's true. Of course it is. Now I understand all that sanctimonious garbage... all those secret bounties that came from nowhere... Ha... Georgia... I trusted you."],["Georgia","...I never wronged you, Gutzman."],["Gutzman","You lied to me when I still had a choice! You tricked me into serving the people I hate most!"],["Georgia","......"],["","Georgia presses her lips into a thin line. A flash of anger crosses her eyes."],["Georgia","When you insisted on joining Iguana, I warned you. I turned you down—our paths were different, and one day you'd regret it."],["","Gutzman grits his teeth."],["Georgia","But you said you didn't care. Everyone walks a different road, and even a brief crossing can create an opportunity. Anyone chasing greatness has to know when to seize it."],["","Gutzman's face twists. His own words from years ago pierce the distance between then and now, driving into his heart like blades."],["Georgia","You've always known how to judge the moment and seize an opportunity. When you want something, your ruthlessness makes you almost untouchable... I've always admired that."],["Georgia","If you'd known I was from the DLAF back then, would you truly have refused to work with me? Maybe not. Otherwise, why would our paths cross again here and now?"],["","Georgia gives Michaela a cool glance."],["Gutzman","...That's different!"],["Georgia","It isn't, Gutzman! You simply refuse to admit it. You refuse to forgive."],["Georgia","You always knew that however many choices seemed to lie before you, there was only ever one road. You had to crawl out of that jungle and throw yourself into this world, or die nameless in the flames."],["Georgia","But that road cost you dearly. The fire has burned in your heart for years, and no amount of wealth can drown it."],["Georgia","If you don't spit that fire at someone else, it'll burn you alive."],["Gutzman","......"],["Gutzman","Heh... heh-heh... Don't paint me as some monster, Georgia. You're no saint... We're the same, you and I. You just refuse to face it. How much blood have you spilled to get what you wanted?"],["Georgia","......"],["","Something stirs in Georgia's expression, but it quickly settles."],["Georgia","Maybe we are bound for the same end. But Gutzman, at least I owe you nothing."],["Gutzman","...Bullshit... Heh... There are more scores between us than I could ever count, and you can stand there and calmly pretend you've let it all go?"],["","A trace of mockery cuts across Georgia's impassive face."],["Georgia","Let it go? How could I let go of someone who wants me dead? Don't misunderstand, Gutzman. Sooner or later, I will kill you."],["Gutzman","Heh... Cough, cough! Cough—ha-ha-ha! That's right, Georgia. That's right."],["","Gutzman laughs and staggers several steps. Before he can steady himself, his hand moves instinctively toward the holster at his waist."],["Gutzman","That's what I've always wanted to tell you..."],["","Behind him... a faint rush of air suddenly whispers—"],["Georgia Mercenary","Stop! Gutzman! You can't take another step back!"],["","Bang!"],["","Gutzman's body jolts. A sudden bullet punches clean through the hand resting on his holster. Georgia stands with a cold, hard expression, pistol steady and muzzle smoking."],["Georgia","That was a warning. No..."],["Georgia Mercenary","Boss!!!"],["","Georgia's trusted aide goes pale. A black gun barrel slides out beneath Gutzman's arm and erupts in a burst of muzzle fire!"],["Georgia Mercenary","Boss!!!"],["Georgia","Ugh—!"],["","Her aide tackles Georgia to the ground as a dull impact slams into her chest. The round strikes her ballistic vest, leaving a deep crater. She reacts instantly, whips her gun toward an unexpected target, and pulls the trigger."],["","Blood mist bursts outward. Alton drops where he stands, a bullet through his brain. He dies instantly."],["Georgia","Damn it... Those bastards!"],["","The scene erupts into chaos beneath thunderous gunfire. Michaela reacts first, dragging Gutzman behind cover. Blood pours from his arm, leaving her no choice but to cinch on a crude tourniquet."],["Michaela","What the hell?! She takes a bullet and stays on her feet, while you're already losing consciousness?!"],["Gutzman","...You're too loud. Go... chase her. Kill her."],["","Gutzman is already burning with fever, but he clings to consciousness long enough to force the order out."],["Michaela","You've got a concussion, so stop talking! Tch. Georgia always has another trick. She realizes what's happening and kills Alton on the spot—doesn't give anyone a chance to exploit the chaos."],["","Michaela risks a quick look at the fighting, then slings Gutzman over her shoulder and moves."],["Michaela","Alton's dead, and you're half-dead. Fighting Georgia now isn't worth the cost. Counselor, we're taking the loss this time—we're pulling out!"],["Gutzman","No... kill her..."],["","Michaela gives Gutzman a conflicted look. Before she can take another step, dust and rubble explode several meters into the air beneath her feet. She stumbles and drags Gutzman down with her as pain blooms across her back."],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss! Are you alright?!"],["","A massive shadow falls over Michaela: the ST piloted by her trusted aide. She seizes the chance to glance back and finds Blue Bird aiming a sniper rifle at them—where it found one, she has no idea."],["Michaela","That devil Georgia! She did it on purpose! She never meant to let Gutzman leave alive! Ngh... Good thing that shot was blocked, or I'd be paste by now—"],["","Michaela's gaze locks for a beat. Beside her, Gutzman lies drenched in blood, unconscious once more."],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss! Leave Gutzman to me! Get back in your ST!"],["Michaela","Damn it—damn it!"],["","Michaela needs no further urging. She leaves Gutzman, scrambles up, and runs for Mithril's rope ladder, teeth bared against the pain."],["Michaela","Listen up! Don't get drawn into a fight. Do not engage! Split into three groups and withdraw. Keep comms open and relay Georgia's position in real time!"],["","Mithril powers up and blasts a path open."],["Michaela","Take Gutzman. E3 squad, with me!"],["Michaela","Good news: only a few pursuers are following. We'll ambush them at the next pass and wipe them out."],["Michaela Mercenary","Got it, Boss!"],["Michaela","Got what? You've got another job. Get our counselor to a hospital! Can't you see he's bleeding out?!"],["Michaela Mercenary","Huh? But Boss, I'd rather go with you..."],["Michaela","Enough. Follow my orders. His wounds can't wait."],["Michaela Mercenary","Uh... fine."],["","Michaela's aide reluctantly guides the ST carrying Gutzman away at speed. Michaela leads the rest of her people into cover to wait for their opening."],["","Time passes, and the horizon shows nothing but wavering heat haze. Michaela's patience begins to fray—until static crackles in her ear."],["","Kzzzt—Michaela—kzzzt—"],["Michaela","You're awake? Then save your breath. Talk when you reach the hospital."],["Gutzman","Georgia... Is she... dead?"],["Michaela","No. She was wearing a ballistic vest—what a killjoy... Tch. Today could've gone better."],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman says nothing. Unease prickles at Michaela; the explosion may have made his injuries worse."],["Michaela","Hey. Just say something—anything. Stay awake. Don't pass out. Hey, Gutzman? Hey!!"],["Gutzman","...You're too loud."],["Michaela","If it works, it works. Just stay conscious... Tch. You survive all that and don't have anything to say? Come on, talk to me."],["Gutzman","..."],["Michaela","Hey—hey! Stay with me. Don't fall asleep. If you do, that's it."],["Gutzman","...She... never used to do that."],["Michaela","What?"],["Gutzman","Wear a bulletproof vest."],["Michaela","Oh, we're back to that. Yeah, she really values her life these days. Next time I'll put a few more rounds into her—fight first, shoot last."],["Gutzman","Shoot first... Cough, cough!... Right from the start... Keep shooting until... you're out of ammo... Anything else is suicide."],["Michaela","...She's that strong? Tch. Fine by me. If she weren't, she wouldn't deserve to be my opponent."],["Gutzman","..."],["Michaela","Why'd you go quiet again? Let's talk about something else. You can't keep shutting down on me—pick something you can ramble about."],["Gutzman","......"],["Michaela","Tch. Then answer me this. When I finally become the king of mercenaries, what would you want?"],["Gutzman","...Heh."],["Michaela","Don't laugh! If you really help me get that far, I'll reward you well. Think big—something you want but could never get, or someone you want dead."],["Gutzman","Ah... If that day ever comes..."],["Gutzman","I'll kill you and become the king of mercenaries myself."],["Michaela","Ha-ha-ha! Fine by me. I don't want to be a lonely king. Better to have strong challengers coming for me forever—that way life never gets boring."],["","Gutzman doesn't answer. Michaela hears only a faint, muffled laugh."],["Michaela","Hey, Counselor. From what Georgia said, sounds like there's plenty of bad blood between you and Iguana."],["Gutzman","...Hmph. More than you know..."],["Michaela","I'm curious—if, and I mean if, you'd known Georgia had ties to the DLAF, would you still have joined Iguana?"],["Gutzman","...None of your business."],["Michaela","Tch. I'm just making conversation. If you get bored, you'll pass out again. Let me put it another way: do you regret it now?"],["","Do you regret that so much of what you've achieved rests on the very organization you despise? That you discarded your family's legacy, left home, became a mercenary... and suffered failure and death again and again?"],["Gutzman","Kzzzt—kzzzt—"],["","A noise comes over the channel. Gutzman says nothing. Perhaps he's shifting in his seat, the fabric of his clothes—soaked in blood, then dried stiff—scraping softly against itself."],["Gutzman","Imagine it. One day, you're dying. You stand at the very end and look back over your life. What do you think you'll feel?"],["Michaela","In this little \"what if\" of yours, am I the king of mercenaries?"],["Gutzman","Maybe...?"],["Michaela","Then that's enough. If I live long enough to become the king of mercenaries, I'll be satisfied. Maybe I'll have one small regret... I won't know whether I'm the only strong person left in the world."],["Gutzman","...Heh. Right. At death's door, if you look back and find you never did the one thing you truly wanted... all you can feel is regret. Regret that you didn't live to reach it..."],["Gutzman","...But will that day ever really come...?"],["","He murmurs to himself, then suddenly breaks into an uncontrollable laugh. Georgia may be his rival and enemy, but she's also the person who knows him best. After all their years fighting side by side, she has long since seen through him."],["","Her blunt, honest, merciless words drag every scrap of rage he's kept locked inside into the open and force him to face it... but what good does that do?"],["","It only makes the fire in his heart burn hotter. It only drives one truth deeper: no choice he could make will ever take him back to the beginning."],["","To survive, to fill the hollow inside him, to smother a rage that never dies, he has taken countless lives, fortunes, and seats of power. Yet everything he possesses only reminds him of everything he lost."],["","All of it... forever beyond his reach."],["Gutzman","Still... there's nothing to regret. Michaela, people have to learn to accept regret. I've had plenty of good days in my life. Pretending I regret it all would be downright pathetic."],["Gutzman","Wasn't it... you who said it? People like us don't get good endings... And if that's true... stop torturing yourself. Heh."],["","Michaela says nothing as Gutzman's hoarse laughter rasps over the channel. On the horizon, the silhouettes of an ST squad rise into view... The pursuers are here."],["Michaela","If you want to keep living the good life, make damn sure you survive this one too, Counselor. You've got to stay alive until... well, the day you kill me and become the king of mercenaries."],["","Mithril has shut down nearly all power, leaving only its essential surveillance systems active. Its electronic eye flickers at high frequency, rapidly recording, analyzing, and feeding environmental data to Michaela."],["Gutzman","Heh... You butcher..."],["Michaela","Coming up, coming up—a massacre's about to begin, Counselor. So what's it gonna be? Pass out for a while, or tune in for a live broadcast of your boss heroically slaughtering the enemy?"],["","Iguana's pursuers close in, weapons in hand and blood up. They have no idea danger lies coiled nearby like a serpent waiting to strike."],["Gutzman","Strange... Michaela, I can see that grove again."],["Michaela","Huh? What? What grove?"],["","Gutzman's out-of-nowhere remark catches Michaela off guard. She rifles through her memory until an image suddenly surfaces."],["Michaela","Oh, you mean the poplar grove we passed on the way to Sema Town? Good. That means you're not far from the nearest hospital."],["Gutzman","—Let's... go take a look first."],["Michaela","What?! Are you insane? That tourniquet can barely keep you from bleeding out, and now you want to visit some grove instead of getting to a hospital?!"],["","Michaela curses under her breath and rapidly reboots Mithril's control systems. At this output, their ST signal will register on the enemy's sensors instantly—but by then, it is already too late."],["","Mithril bursts from cover, twin guns raised—the ambush begins."],["Gutzman","A grove that large is incredibly hard to establish. Desert groundwater is too saline for irrigation, so newly planted saplings have to be watered by hand for their first three years..."],["Michaela","You really can't stop thinking about those trees... Even now, you're still going on about them! If you love them that much, buy yourself a plot and plant your own grove. It's not like you're short on cash!"],["","Mithril keeps shifting position and firing. One ST after another reels under its barrage."],["Gutzman","Even once you've secured the water, you have to protect them from animals... Cough! There are jerboas in the desert that can chew through most of your freshly planted saplings in a single night..."],["","Gutzman's voice drifts in and out over the channel. Lost in the rhythm of gunfire, Michaela catches only scraps before realizing he isn't talking to her at all—he's just talking to himself."],["Michaela","Plant them now, and in three years I guarantee your grove will be lush and magnificent. If that's too much trouble, I'll teach you another trick—heh!"],["","An ST suddenly charges Mithril. Michaela reacts in a flash and puts a round clean through its cockpit."],["Michaela","Another head delivered right to me! Ha-ha! Beautiful—oh! Counselor, where was I? Right, another trick. Find that ranger and put a bullet in him. Then you can claim the whole grove ready-made!"],["","Boom!—Another ST erupts as Mithril ducks behind cover to reload. Even with her attention split, Michaela thinks she catches a faint sigh."],["Gutzman","Years ago, a band of mercenaries... every bit as murderous as you... stormed my village."],["Gutzman","They wanted to take the village as their base. I fought back with everything I had... but you can guess how much good that did."],["Michaela","Damn shame, Counselor. If only you'd been as strong back then as you are now—"],["","The bloodlust takes Michaela again, and she never notices the barrel trained on Mithril from afar. The ambusher tracks and aims with a rock-steady hand, not a tremor in sight."],["Gutzman","Yeah... If only I'd been the man I am now... If only."],["Gutzman","I just... can't accept it."],["","Bang!"],["","Mithril reels back several steps, sparks spraying from its entire right arm. Michaela doesn't flinch. Trusting instinct alone, she unleashes a barrage toward the incoming fire. Moments later, an explosion answers."],["","At that moment—the last blinking red dot vanishes from the scanner."],["Michaela","Ha! You little bastard. Thought you could get the drop on me?"],["","Mithril scans the area. In only a few minutes, the ground is littered with shattered ST wreckage. Michaela flicks her wrist, working out the strain from overuse."],["Michaela","Alright, everyone, pull out—Counselor, I'm done here. We'll meet at the hospital."],["Gutzman","..."],["Michaela","Counselor? What's wrong? Don't tell me you passed out."],["Michaela Mercenary","B-Boss..."],["Michaela","Where are you? What's your status?"],["Michaela Mercenary","Uh, Boss... I think you need to see this for yourself..."],["","A live feed suddenly opens before Michaela. Inside the dim cockpit, thin rivulets of blood run down from the pilot's seat. Gutzman sits slumped against it, eyes wide and staring straight ahead."],["Michaela","Gutzman...?"],["","No one answers. Then Michaela realizes every trace of light has left Gutzman's eyes. The focus and yearning that mark a living person are gone. All that remains is an empty shell already yielding to decay."],["Michaela","Ah..."],["Michaela Mercenary","He wanted to go there. We were right behind him the whole way, and then... he just stopped."],["","The feed shifts. Michaela sees the poplar grove standing in the distance, wrapped in windblown sand and a serene stillness."],["Michaela","...Ha... Is that so?"],["","Michaela runs her fingers over the control stick. She falls silent, and a rare seriousness settles over her face."],["Michaela","What a shame, Counselor... I thought we'd keep working together a while longer. Never thought you'd reach the end first."],["","Gutzman says nothing—and of course, he never will again."],["","The poplar grove stands only a short distance away. But for him, it now lies across an uncrossable gulf between life and death... He will never reach it in this lifetime."],["Michaela","Alright, brother. Your old employer is dead—and I didn't kill him, so don't come to me for revenge. Your crew is missing too. How about giving my offer another thought and running with me?"],["Michaela","As you can see, I've got big ambitions. Run with me, and you won't lose out."],["Keller","......"],["Michaela","Well? Say something, brother. Don't start picking up bad habits from Mr. Strong and Silent."],["Keller","......"],["","Keller thinks it over for a moment."],["Keller","How far are you trying to go?"],["Michaela","All the way to the top! King of mercenaries in Milkhama!"],["Keller","...I just want to keep food on the table."],["Michaela","...You think running with the king of mercenaries won't keep you fed?"],["Keller","It'll get me thrown in prison."],["Michaela","Oh, relax. My current employer has serious pull. We're not going to prison."],["","Keller looks doubtful."],["Keller","...Still too risky. I only want small jobs now. With a goal that big, you'll drag me somewhere... I won't be able to turn back from."],["Michaela","Like where?"],["Keller","...A ditch."],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela falls silent. She studies Keller for a long moment, sighs, then walks over and pats him on the shoulder."],["Michaela","Fine. I won't pressure you. If you change your mind later, contact me anytime."],["","With that, she leaves without looking back, raising one hand in a casual wave."],["Michaela Mercenary","Hah. Kid has no eye for opportunity. He just passed up the closest he'll ever come to success!"],["Michaela","Tch..."],["","Michaela suddenly stops and looks into the distance. Far away, a thriving poplar grove stands tall. Beneath that earth, a sinful soul lies buried."],["","\"But Michaela, if we follow in their footsteps, where will we end up?\""],["Michaela","Hey, tell me—"],["Michaela Mercenary","What?"],["Michaela","What do you think Gutzman saw when he died?"],["Michaela Mercenary","Uh... I've never died, Boss. I don't know."],["Michaela","Right? No one can predict the hour of their death... Maybe we'll only know when our day comes."],["Michaela Mercenary","Know what?"],["Michaela","You'll know when the time comes."],["Michaela Mercenary","Huh?! Know what? What am I supposed to know, Boss?!"],["","Michaela smiles and shakes her head, leaving her subordinate behind as she strides ahead."]]};
